Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:02:04 2026 +0330

    fix(qa4-img15): persona-specific funnel stage texts (AI tier + rotation fallback)
    
    The three hardcoded stage sentences (smart_funnel_engine.py:492,508,520)
    made every persona's TOFU/MOFU/BOFU cards identical. Now:
    - AI tier: one batched JSON call per persona (capped 4) generates
      headline_angle/body_approach from that persona's pains/fears/goals;
      15s timeout, malformed/empty -> fallback; FUNNEL_AI_TEXT=0 kill-switch.
    - Deterministic tier: 4 distinct templates per stage (12 total) rotated
      by persona index so two personas never share a template, each
      referencing the persona's own pain/fear/goal.
    - campaign/tests_qa4_funnel_texts.py: 12 tests (differentiation, prompt
      content, fallback paths, kill-switch).

